{"3880350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WTF AM I PLAYING?!", "steam_appid": 3880350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WTF AM I PLAYING?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the game that makes you ask... well, exactly that. If you’re tired of logic, rules, and sensible gameplay, congratulations — you’re in the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/8684286aa7f81cc42182f5af8a5dac4a.poster.avif?t=1768648088\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/8684286aa7f81cc42182f5af8a5dac4a.webm?t=1768648088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/8684286aa7f81cc42182f5af8a5dac4a.mp4?t=1768648088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t your grandma’s FPS. It’s a fast-paced, retro-inspired chaos  full of weird enemies, ridiculous weapons, and moments that will make you question your life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can handle the madness? You’ll be figuring things out on the fly, doing your best to keep up, and maybe wondering how you got here.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/49c04c460ee5f13458aa53e532e202a9.poster.avif?t=1768648088\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/49c04c460ee5f13458aa53e532e202a9.webm?t=1768648088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/49c04c460ee5f13458aa53e532e202a9.mp4?t=1768648088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So grab your keyboard and mouse, and prepare to question the name of the game!<br>------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WTF AM I PLAYING?!</strong> is a first-person shooter with elements of platforming, puzzles, and experimental comedy. It blends fast-paced action with unexpected scenarios, minimal guidance, and surreal humor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay &amp; Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uniquely designed levels with their own mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person shooter gameplay with puzzle and platforming elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized retro graphics and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies: angry chickens, mutant burgers, giant gorillas, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic soundtrack and sound design tailored to each level’s tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No loading screens between core sequences — just smooth, weird transitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short session-friendly level structure. (15–20 minutes per level.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main content offers around 2–3 hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes — you’ll keep wondering what’s going on, and why you’re enjoying it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect for players who enjoy:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unconventional, unpredictable gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired visuals and effects that evoke classic gaming nostalgia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced FPS action with a twist of humor and unexpected challenges.</p></li><li><p cl